{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (CAREGIVER): Sorry we're late, doctor. Uh the M50 was desperate and the car park was full.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (DOCTOR): Not a bother. Sit down.",
  "[SEG0003] person_3 (NURSE): Chart's on the desk. Observations done, blood pressure one twenty eight over seventy six, pulse 72, oxygen ninety eight.",
  "[SEG0004] person_1 (CAREGIVER): The rain was wicked. We had the hurling on the whole way in and then it bucketed down at the gate.",
  "[SEG0005] person_2 (DOCTOR): Who won it?",
  "[SEG0006] person_1 (CAREGIVER): Dublin, again. My sister's young fella had a tenner on Galway and he's still not talking.",
  "[SEG0007] person_2 (DOCTOR): Right. What brought you in?",
  "[SEG0008] person_4 (PATIENT): Can I drive.",
  "[SEG0009] person_2 (DOCTOR): The licence. You've the epilepsy.",
  "[SEG0010] person_4 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0011] person_2 (DOCTOR): Still taking the levetiracetam?",
  "[SEG0012] person_1 (CAREGIVER): The kepra, yeah. Seven fifty by mouth, twice a day.",
  "[SEG0013] person_2 (DOCTOR): Levetiracetam for the epilepsy. Seven hundred and fifty milligrams, twice daily, by mouth.",
  "[SEG0014] person_2 (DOCTOR): Any doses missed?",
  "[SEG0015] person_4 (PATIENT): Spain.",
  "[SEG0016] person_2 (DOCTOR): Missed tablets. Not where.",
  "[SEG0017] person_4 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0018] person_2 (DOCTOR): How many did you miss?",
  "[SEG0019] person_4 (PATIENT): Three.",
  "[SEG0020] person_1 (CAREGIVER): Three mornings. Left the box in the hotel, first week we were in Spain.",
  "[SEG0021] person_2 (DOCTOR): Any seizure since I last saw you?",
  "[SEG0022] person_4 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0023] person_2 (DOCTOR): Err, two years clear?",
  "[SEG0024] person_4 (PATIENT): Yeah.",
  "[SEG0025] person_1 (CAREGIVER): Well actually, I saw a blank spell last month.",
  "[SEG0026] person_2 (DOCTOR): Tell me.",
  "[SEG0027] person_1 (CAREGIVER): The blank spell, last month, at the kitchen table. He stopped, staring, maybe twenty seconds, then on with the tea like nothing.",
  "[SEG0028] person_2 (DOCTOR): So did you have a seizure?",
  "[SEG0029] person_4 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0030] person_2 (DOCTOR): Any warning beforehand?",
  "[SEG0031] person_4 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0032] person_2 (DOCTOR): Tongue biting?",
  "[SEG0033] person_4 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0034] person_2 (DOCTOR): Did you wet yourself?",
  "[SEG0035] person_4 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0036] person_1 (CAREGIVER): No jerks or anything. I couldn't tell you the exact day mind, sometime last month. Umm might have been a Tuesday.",
  "[SEG0037] person_2 (DOCTOR): Headache after it?",
  "[SEG0038] person_4 (PATIENT): Tuesday.",
  "[SEG0039] person_2 (DOCTOR): Headache. Yes or no.",
  "[SEG0040] person_4 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0041] person_1 (CAREGIVER): Ah before I forget, Lily started junior infants this week. The schoolbag is bigger than herself, and the traffic at that gate had us forty minutes getting out of the estate, and the dog still had to be walked in the rain. My sister rang in the middle of it still going on about the hurling.",
  "[SEG0042] person_2 (DOCTOR): Grand so. Back to this. Any problems with your breathing?",
  "[SEG0043] person_4 (PATIENT): No.",
  "[SEG0044] person_2 (DOCTOR): I'd treat that blank spell as a probable seizure.",
  "[SEG0045] person_2 (DOCTOR): You're not to drive. Tell the NDLS. The clear year starts again from that spell. And don't be missing the tablets on holidays.",
  "[SEG0046] person_4 (PATIENT): Right.",
  "[SEG0047] person_2 (DOCTOR): I'll book a blood test for the levetiracetam level because of the missed doses.",
  "[SEG0048] person_3 (NURSE): I can slot him in downstairs this afternoon.",
  "[SEG0049] person_2 (DOCTOR): Come back in two weeks and we'll go through it.",
  "[SEG0050] person_4 (PATIENT): Yeah."
 ],
